              {
                "id": "GTd5cc389b8d6832a3a5227582d652ee4d",
                "participantSid": "unknown",
                "sequenceId": "2",
                "text": "もしもし。",
                "timestamp": "2025-07-02T00:01:21.184Z",
                "track": "outbound_track"
              },
              {
                "id": "GTd5cc389b8d6832a3a5227582d652ee4d",
                "participantSid": "unknown",
                "sequenceId": "3",
                "text": " に翻訳します。",
                "timestamp": "2025-07-02T00:01:36.273Z",
                "track": "outbound_track"
              },
              {
                "id": "GTd5cc389b8d6832a3a5227582d652ee4d",
                "participantSid": "unknown",
                "sequenceId": "4",
                "text": "今日の天気って さな。どうだった？",
                "timestamp": "2025-07-02T00:01:45.102Z",
                "track": "outbound_track"
              },
              {
                "id": "GTd5cc389b8d6832a3a5227582d652ee4d",
                "participantSid": "unknown",
                "sequenceId": "5",
                "text": " 今日の東京の天気は最高気温が約30°で晴れ時ど曇りの予報です。湿度も高めなので、熱中症に注意して水分をこまめに取ると良いでしょう。また日焼け止めを忘れずに使ってくださいね。",
                "timestamp": "2025-07-02T00:02:01.708Z",
                "track": "outbound_track"
              },
              {
                "id": "GTd5cc389b8d6832a3a5227582d652ee4d",
                "participantSid": "unknown",
                "sequenceId": "6",
                "text": "通訳 しよう。",
                "timestamp": "2025-07-02T00:02:09.474Z",
                "track": "inbound_track"
              },
              {
                "id": "GTd5cc389b8d6832a3a5227582d652ee4d",
                "participantSid": "unknown",
                "sequenceId": "7",
                "text": " ということでした。いいですかね？",
                "timestamp": "2025-07-02T00:02:32.456Z",
                "track": "inbound_track"
              },
              {
                "id": "GTd5cc389b8d6832a3a5227582d652ee4d",
                "participantSid": "unknown",
                "sequenceId": "8",
                "text": "ありがとうございました。",
                "timestamp": "2025-07-02T00:03:02.856Z",
                "track": "outbound_track"
              }
            ]
          },
          "dateCreated": "2025-07-02T00:01:21.000Z"
        },
